,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[71,66,55,41,46,68],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"1800","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10014","armor":"WP1006705","helmet":"WP1023705"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10128","city":"CS1039","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[71,66,55,41,46,68],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"1800","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10014","armor":"WP1006705","helmet":"WP1023705"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"蜀国武将。诸葛亮北伐期间跟随马谡守卫街亭，担任马谡军队后卫粮仓管理。后续北伐中听命诸葛亮使用木牛流马运粮，并引诱魏军夺之，使魏军中计被蜀军所伏击。","tc":"蜀國武將。諸葛亮北伐期間跟隨馬謖守衛街亭，擔任馬謖軍隊后衛糧倉管理。后續北伐中聽命諸葛亮使用木牛流馬運糧，并引誘魏軍奪之，使魏軍中計被蜀軍所伏擊。","en":"Officer of Shu. During Zhuge Liang's Northern Expeditions, he accompanied Ma Su in defending Jieting, serving as rear guard and supply manager for Ma Su's army. In later campaigns, he operated the Wooden Oxen and Gliding Horses on Zhuge Liang's orders to transport supplies, baiting the Wei army into seizing the devices and thereby luring them into a Shu ambush.","jp":"蜀の武将。諸葛亮の北伐の際、馬謖に従って街亭を守備し、馬謖軍の後方で兵糧庫の管理を務めた。その後の北伐では諸葛亮の命を受けて木牛流馬で兵糧を輸送し、魏軍を誘引してこれを奪わせることで計略に陥れ、蜀軍の伏兵により撃破させた。","kr":"촉나라의 무장. 제갈량의 북벌 당시 마속을 따라 가정을 지키며 마속 군 후방의 군량고 관리를 맡았다. 이후 북벌에서도 제갈량의 명을 받들어 목우유마로 군량을 수송하고 위군을 유인해 이를 빼앗게 함으로써, 위군이 계책에 빠져 촉군의 매복에 걸려들게 했다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ10423","remark":"","surname":"高","surnameTc":"高","surnameEn":"Gao","surnameJp":"高","surnameKr":"고","surnameOther":"","name":"翔","nameTc":"翔","nameEn":"Xiang","nameJp":"翔","nameKr":"상","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"高翔","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"0","workYear":"213","city":"CS1005","gender":"0","r